BaseConfigLib::initializeFillExpiry
├── given zero entries
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single entry
│   ├── it should write packed min/max to storage for chainId
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple entries
│   ├── it should write all entries to storage
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
